<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset='UTF-8' />
    <title>Password Reset Request</title>
    <link
      href='https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;600;700&display=swap'
      rel='stylesheet'
    />
    <style>
      body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; background-color: #f9f9f9;
      margin: 0; padding: 0; color: #333; } .container { background-color:
      #ffffff; max-width: 700px; margin: 40px auto; border-radius: 10px;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); overflow: hidden; border-top:
      5px solid #dc3545; } .header { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #dc3545
      0%, #c82333 100%); padding: 30px; text-align: center; color: white; }
      .header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 24px; text-transform: uppercase; }
      .section { padding: 30px; line-height: 1.6; } .section h2 { color:
      #dc3545; font-size: 20px; } .reset-box { margin: 20px 0; padding: 25px;
      border-radius: 6px; background-color: #f3f4f6; border: 2px dashed
      #dc3545; color: #333; font-weight: 600; text-align: center; }
      .reset-button { display: inline-block; padding: 15px 30px; margin: 15px
      0; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #dc3545 0%, #c82333 100%); color:
      white !important; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 8px; font-weight:
      600; font-size: 16px; border: none; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.3s
      ease; box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(220, 53, 69, 0.3); } .reset-button:hover
      { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #c82333 0%, #bd2130 100%);
      box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(220, 53, 69, 0.4); transform: translateY(-2px);
      } .warning-box { margin: 20px 0; padding: 20px; border-radius: 6px;
      background-color: #fef3c7; border: 1px solid #f59e0b; color: #92400e;
      font-size: 14px; } .footer { font-size: 12px; color: #777; text-align:
      center; padding: 25px; background-color: #f8f9fa; } .footer a { color:
      #dc3545; text-decoration: none; } .greeting { font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 16px; } .paragraph { margin-bottom: 16px;
      font-size: 14px; } .signature { margin-top: 24px; font-size: 14px; }
      .token-display { margin: 15px 0; padding: 15px; background-color: #fff;
      border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 4px; font-family: monospace;
      font-size: 14px; word-break: break-all; color: #333; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class='container'>
      <div class='header'>
        <h1>ASFAAR VISA SERVICES</h1>
      </div>

      <div class='section'>
        <h2 class='greeting'>Hello {{userName}},</h2>

        <p class='paragraph'>
          We received a request to reset your password for your Asfaar Visa
          Services account. If you made this request, please click the button
          below to reset your password.
        </p>

        <div class='reset-box'>
          <p>Click the button below to reset your password:</p>
          <a href='{{resetUrl}}' class='reset-button'>Reset Password</a>
          <p style='margin-top: 15px; font-size: 12px; color: #666;'>
            This link will expire in <strong>1 hour</strong>
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class='warning-box'>
          <strong>Security Notice:</strong>
          If you didn't request a password reset, please ignore this email. Your
          password will remain unchanged. Never share this link with anyone. If
          you're concerned about your account security, please contact our
          support team immediately.
        </div>

        <p class='paragraph'>
          If you're having trouble with the reset button, you can also copy and
          paste the following link into your browser:
        </p>

        <div class='token-display'>
          {{resetUrl}}
        </div>

        <p class='paragraph'>
          <strong>Important:</strong>
          For security reasons, this password reset link can only be used once.
          If you need to reset your password again, please request a new reset
          link.
        </p>

        <p class='paragraph'>
          If you continue to have issues or didn't request this password reset,
          please contact our support team for assistance.
        </p>

        <p class='signature'>
          Best regards,<br />
          The Asfaar Team
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class='footer'>
        <p>For inquiries:
          <a
            href='mailto:info@asfaarvisaservices.com'
          >info@asfaarvisaservices.com</a>
          | Visit:
          <a
            href='https://www.asfaarvisaservices.com'
          >www.asfaarvisaservices.com</a></p>
        <p><strong>Hotline:</strong>
          +234 700 700 4001 |
          <strong>Open Hours:</strong>
          Mon-Fri 08:00 - 18:00</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>

